ned form of  this power would look like  in my opinion the reason he was so sure  of these things and why he was willing  to spend all this money is due to the  fact that as a creation of the villains  he had already seen the full potential  of decay in the past on at least one  occasion tomorrow's backstory proved  that decay was always able to transfer  from one object to another it's just  that for most of his life he  subconsciously limited its potential but  anyone who knew shigaraki as a child  would know what the awakened decay could  do  additionally if you believe the theory  that decay was given to shiguraki by  alpha 1 which i happen to believe then  that means someone else in the past also  had this same power which is another  reason why nezu would be aware of his  full potential  as the principle he then did everything  he could to counter against this threat  but if he is truly a puppet of the  villains like kirigiri then everything  he's done might play into all one's  hands for example we know that the ue  barrier allows the school to be  separated into individual parts which  are then sent underground meaning that  if the villains break in nezu could be  ordered to trap midori and shigiraki in  the same section of ua and then have  that section sent underground where  there would be no escape  anyhow to recap the whole theory might  seemingly have a strong connection to  the origin of quirks and would  definitely have been studied by dr  garaki while he was researching for  evidence to support his singularity  theory as garaki's understanding of  quirk's increase he would have begun  conducting experiments that laid the  foundations for the things he does today  such as transferring and duplicating  these abilities  in the case of nezu he was already  confirmed to have gone through horrific  experiments in his past so when we  consider the relevance of mice and the  fact that every other quirk having  animal has a connection to the villains  nezu w